{"id":"Wfb449f6aad1f346b9a2cbe7e","zh":"安全裕量系数","en":"","name":"安全裕量系数","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wfb449f6aad1f346b9a2cbe7e","text":"安全裕量系数","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sa6f8608b4503a3ce7361","source_id":"P116","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"(2)由于车辆-轨道系统存在众多的随机因素,因此需要确定系统动力指标Indexl的安全裕量系数γl, 以此确定动力指标限值 Indexlim, l=Indexl/γl (10) 式中: l为不同的动力指标。","citations":[{"source_id":"P116","page":5,"page_end":5}]},{"id":"S85b54b23ea98036d044a","source_id":"P116","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"为了建立较为细致的青藏铁路轨道不平顺界限谱,取80、100、120、140km/h 4个速度等级,取车体垂、横向振动加速度,垂、横向平稳性指标4个动力指标(因为本文所分析的轨道谱无法表达短波不平顺,故未取轮重减载率指标;由前面的分析可知,脱轨系数极难超限,故亦未取之),取安全裕量系数γl=1.","citations":[{"source_id":"P116","page":5,"page_end":5}]}],"sources":{"P116":{"id":"P116","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺界限谱研究","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明,陈宪麦,高建敏","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.05.015","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-research-on-track-irregularity-boundary-psds-of-qinghai-tibet-railway"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"制定动力限值时考虑系统随机因素的系数，算例取1.2。","language":"zh","source_id":"P116","paper_slug":"2018-research-on-track-irregularity-boundary-psds-of-qinghai-tibet-railway","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺界限谱研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wf6e55e8780a20e80915e3dce","name":"Safety margin coefficient","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wf6e55e8780a20e80915e3dce","name":"Safety margin coefficient","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"Wf6e55e8780a